WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:37.680
Zorc's power is so strong that if nothing changes, we can't win.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:42.660
Our only option was to gather the Millennium Items scattered in the desert.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:47.200
But on her way back, Isis was defeated.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.990
As was Shimon and his Exodia!

00:01:50.990 --> 00:01:54.960
I won't let everyone's sacrifice go to waste!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:00.970
Summon!  The Three Gods

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:20.690
The Cursed Twin Dolls’ black box eliminated my graveyard.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:28.210
The monsters, spells and traps that were sent to my graveyard are floating over my field as ghosts.

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:30.780
But don’t be alarmed, Yugi.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:36.210
They can't attack, defend or activate effects.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:41.450
I have a bad feeling about this, but I can’t afford to lose.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.210
I end my turn.

00:02:47.490 --> 00:02:49.680
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:50.920
Hold up!

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:56.270
Necro Soldier’s effect activates.

00:02:56.270 --> 00:03:02.960
When this card is in play during your Standby Phase, I gain a Necro Soldier.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:10.620
The Special Summoned Necro Soldier’s effect also activates.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.220
I have one more!

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:17.210
No way!  He suddenly has three Necro Soldiers!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:22.160
They have 0 attack and defense points, but they're still trouble.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.220
However...

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:28.910
Silent Swordsman rises to Level 5 this turn!

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:34.700
Then I summon Silent Magician LV0 from my hand in attack position!

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:44.590
Marshmallon, Silent Magician and Silent Swordsman attack the three Necro Soldiers!

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:49.280
Nice!  Every monster on Bakura’s field will be destroyed!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.420
Why?

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.660
Why did Silent Swordsman stop its attack?

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:10.920
I activated the Continuous Trap, Narrow Corridor.

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:11.970
What?

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:13.670
Narrow Corridor?

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:21.410
Due to this trap, you can only attack with up to two monsters.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:23.280
Too bad.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:28.920
No matter how many monsters you summon, you can only attack with two.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.230
And...

00:04:30.810 --> 00:04:32.150
Look, Yugi!

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:38.890
The destroyed monsters remain on the field as ghosts.

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:44.130
That means every time I attack, he'll have more monsters on his field.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:46.700
My turn!  I draw!

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:55.240
The moment you draw, Silent Magician rises to Level 1 and gains 500 attack points.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:02.340
I drew this at the perfect time.

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:06.590
Yugi, my death ritual is ready.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.590
Death ritual?

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:14.600
I activate the Continuous Spell, Counterbalance from my hand.

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:16.820
Counterbalance?

00:05:16.820 --> 00:05:17.840
That’s right.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:23.080
When this card is on the field, at the end of a player's turn...

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:34.010
...he has to send a card in his deck to the graveyard for every monster on the field, including the ghosts.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:37.840
Send a card to the graveyard for every monster on the field?

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:39.960
That means...

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:48.590
But if we take turns sending cards to the graveyard, you’re facing the same risk.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.600
You still don't get it, Yugi?

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:59.980
I can't send cards to the graveyard because I don't have a graveyard.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:05.600
Meaning this effect only affects you, Yugi!

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:09.820
A deck-destruction combo that only affects me?

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:11.160
Exactly!

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.880
This combo is really dangerous!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:16.850
Yugi!

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:20.840
I'll get more monsters.

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:24.080
I summon Necro Mannequin in defense position.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:31.880
Then I activate the Continuous Trap on my field, Necro Cycle!

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:34.870
As long as Necro Mannequin is on my field...

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:39.380
...I can Special Summon another Necro Mannequin once per turn.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.110
He has more monsters!

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:48.610
Yugi, how many monsters are on the field now?

00:06:53.100 --> 00:07:01.090
You'll find out how terrifying Counterbalance is next turn, Yugi.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:02.830
I end my turn!

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.980
Pharaoh, I’ll handle this.

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:16.810
No.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:18.110
Leave this to me.

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:20.120
But Pharaoh…

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:24.950
My friends died because they believed in me and our future.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.690
I won’t let their sacrifices go to waste.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:33.070
Zorc!  I won't let you do whatever you want!

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:36.770
The power of the Gods will defeat this demon!

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.170
The three Gods!  Emerge!

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:51.320
Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:53.200
Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.360
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:23.280
I summon the three Gods!

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:30.520
The outcome isn't so certain anymore, Bakura.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.260
So you summoned the three Gods.

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:38.990
Yugi, this will be the last turn.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:42.740
We don't need to play this game on a table anymore!

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:47.740
The fate of the world rests on this single battle.

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:50.570
I don't need this body anymore.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:53.480
I’ll return to my true form!

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.760
I knew it!  You’re Zorc!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:05.230
Yugi, let's go to the battlefield!

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.230
Fine!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:26.080
Zorc, I'll use the power of the Gods to defeat you!

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:33.960
Bring it on, you weak Gods!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:36.950
You can't defeat the power of darkness!

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:46.200
That’s Obelisk, Slifer and Ra!

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:50.710
The battle between the Gods is about to begin!

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:53.900
Go, Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.700
Unleash earth's rage on that demon!

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:11.120
So this is the power of the Gods!

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:22.630
Slifer the Sky Dragon!  Deliver heaven's judgment on this demon!

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.100
Wow!

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:35.340
The Winged Dragon of Ra, let your light dispel that demon’s darkness!

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:50.360
Finish him!

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.600
The three Gods attack simultaneously!

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:58.120
God Hand Crusher!  Thunder Force!  God Phoenix!

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.170
Annihilate him!

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:24.430
Did they win?

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:30.280
That's a God!

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:32.450
That means the demon was...

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.940
Did they defeat Zorc?

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:09.640
The sky is clearing!

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.540
Our Gods won!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:12.450
We did it!

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:14.680
We did it, Prince!

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.440
No.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.410
He's coming.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.660
What?

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.040
The sun…

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.530
How terrifying!

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:33.600
What’s going on?

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:36.850
Zorc is creating an eclipse.

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:44.310
Darkness is covering the world.

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:49.320
Three Gods, defeat Zorc before the land is covered in darkness!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:02.290
Darkness!  Come to me!

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:08.020
The sun...

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:14.500
Slifer!  Ra!

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.810
It won't work!

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:25.510
My darkness is now stronger than the light!

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.490
Darkness!  Tear apart the three Gods!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:31.310
Dark Slasher!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.990
Obelisk!  Slifer!  Ra!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:54.300
No way...

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.260
The Gods…

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:56.480
It can't be!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.980
Impossible!  The Gods were defeated?

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:05.480
The Gods lost!

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:07.000
It’s all over!

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:13.490
I’ve turned your Gods into statues.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:17.710
Watch them crumble, along with hope!

00:14:22.350 --> 00:14:23.710
Prince!

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:32.740
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:38.760
Silent Swordsman rises from Level 5 to 6.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:42.770
Necro Cycle’s trap effect continues.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:46.560
So I summon another Necro Mannequin.

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:52.020
There are now 11 monsters on the field.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:58.280
Damn!  As long as he has Necro Cycle, he'll summon a monster every turn!

00:14:58.280 --> 00:15:05.790
And due to Narrow Corridor, Yugi can only attack with two monsters per turn.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:10.740
And even if you destroy my monsters, they won’t leave the field.

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:15.530
Cursed Twin Dolls’ black box changes them into ghosts.

00:15:15.530 --> 00:15:18.270
What will you do, Yugi?

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:20.010
Even so...

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:29.300
I attack Necro Soldier with Silent Swordsman LV6 and attack Necro Mannequin with Silent Magician LV1!

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.160
Go!

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:39.020
This massacre was brutal, but pointless.

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.530
Time for the ritual, Yugi.

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:48.580
For every monster on the field, send a card in your deck to the graveyard.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.750
There are 11 monsters on the field.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:55.040
11 cards is 1/4 of his deck!

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:03.070
That leaves 17 cards in your deck.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:06.270
But that's good, Yugi.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:17.020
The Cursed Twin Dolls’ red box gives you 200 life points for each card you sent to the graveyard.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:21.020
I end my turn!

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:23.530
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:29.470
I summon Necro Wall in defense position.

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:33.720
Due to Necro Wall’s effect...

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:42.540
...for every Zombie-Type on my field, I can Special Summon a Necro Wall Token during the End Phase.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:43.740
What?

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:44.540
No way!

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:48.720
There are two Zombie-Type monsters on my field.

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:53.560
So I can bring out two more Necro Wall Tokens.

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:56.240
Now there are 14 monsters.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.290
I end my turn.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.530
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:02.260 --> 00:17:10.980
Silent Swordsman LV7 and Silent Magician LV2 attack two Necro Wall Tokens!

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:18.760
Nice! Tokens don’t go to the graveyard!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:23.550
Not only are they gone, they can't return to the field as ghosts!

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:29.560
I activate the spell card, Aria From Beyond from my hand!

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:34.800
I can activate a spell card that’s been removed from play!

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:38.920
The card I choose is Spirit Sword of Sealing!

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:46.320
I use Spirit Sword of Sealing to seal Silent Swordsman LV7!

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:54.600
He sealed Silent Swordsman?

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:59.650
But this means there are three fewer monsters on the field.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:00.860
I end my turn.

00:18:01.340 --> 00:18:05.870
Then discard 11 cards from your deck.

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.370
11 cards?

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:11.870
You now only have five cards left in your deck.

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:18.670
You deck will be destroyed on your next turn.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:22.360
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:32.480
I thought about immediately ending my turn so that it'll be your turn.

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:35.860
But I'll finish you this turn instead.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:40.700
I summon Necro Jar in attack position.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:43.220
Attack Silent Magician!

00:18:43.610 --> 00:18:44.830
What?

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:48.840
Silent Magician has more attack points.

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:57.340
Oh no.  My life points drop to 200.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:18:59.160
Just kidding.

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:02.330
Necro Jar’s effect activates!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:08.540
When this monster is destroyed, for every 300 points of damage I take...

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.370
...I send one card in your deck to the graveyard.

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:14.770
That’s four cards, Yugi.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:18.100
Send four cards in your deck to the graveyard!

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:23.580
Four cards?  That means Yugi only has one card left in his deck!

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:30.860
I planned to finish you just now.

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:37.100
But since you removed Silent Swordsman from play, you were able to keep one card.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:39.160
I end my turn.

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:46.690
There are 14 monsters on the field, and you have one card left.

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:49.850
There’s nothing you can do.

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:55.570
Yugi, you're weak.

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:59.380
Can't do a thing without the Pharaoh?

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:05.460
Yugi!  Don't listen to him!

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:07.260
You’re a duelist!

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.550
Don't give up before it’s over!

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:13.760
But my other self isn't with me anymore.

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:18.140
I thought I was fighting by your side.

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:23.040
But I've only being chasing after you.

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.650
My other self!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:34.090
I can’t give up!

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:41.770
I promised to find your real name and save you!  That's why...

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:43.760
I won’t give up!

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:47.230
My turn!  I draw!

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:50.220
I'll bet everything on this final card!

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.100
That’s the spirit!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:52.970
Yugi!

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.460
What can you do with one mere card?

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:03.410
I tribute Marshmallon and Silent Magician!

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:06.210
I summon Gandora the Dragon of Destruction!

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:07.440
What?

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:19.860
Bakura, my deck has one card that can break your Zombie Lockdown Deck.

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:24.430
Break my Zombie Lockdown?

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:32.670
Gandora the Dragon of Destruction's special magic attack!

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:35.780
Destroy Gigarays!

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:18.060
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:18.220 --> 00:22:33.780
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:39.620
Without a goal in mind

00:22:40.940 --> 00:22:48.190
We just step towards our dream

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:53.830
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:54.020 --> 00:23:02.300
Your eye will find it

00:23:02.660 --> 00:23:08.110
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:16.250
Will touch your soul

00:23:16.440 --> 00:23:19.510
In a duel

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:35.860
Even with the power of the three Gods, he couldn't defeat Zorc.

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:40.490
Yugi, only you can save the fallen Pharaoh!

00:23:40.490 --> 00:23:44.810
Gandora the Dragon of Destruction defeated Bakura.

00:23:44.810 --> 00:23:48.690
Meanwhile, Zorc is destroying the city.

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:51.630
Kaiba!  What are you doing?

00:23:52.260 --> 00:23:56.410
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Zorc vs Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:57.910
Duel, standby!
